	quest.00000000000000AF.quest_desc: [
		"&9PneumaticCraft: Repressurized&r is all about &o&blogistics&r, &o&bautomation&r, and generally blowing things up for profit."
		""
		"Mastering pressurized air and heat will be the beginning of your journey. "
	]
	quest.00000000000000AF.quest_subtitle: "*Unlocked by completing the &b&n&oSteel Ingot&r quest*"
	quest.00000000000000AF.title: "Welcome to &6PneumaticCraft: Repressurized"
	quest.00000000000000BD.quest_desc: [
		"While it won’t have you being visited by danger noodles from space or irradiating the countryside for the next millennium, Pressurized Air can be dangerous in its own right and going over pressure can cause that block to burst and be lost."
		""
		"A simple redstone cut-off can be built for your new Air Compressor with a bit of Redstone and a Repeater."
	]
	quest.00000000000000BD.title: "Air Compressor"
	quest.00000000000000C3.quest_desc: ["Even the best laid plans can be brought to ruin by unexpected events. Install security upgrades in your compressor and pressure chamber to prevent rapid unscheduled disassembly."]
	quest.00000000000000C3.title: "Security Upgrades"
	quest.00000000000000C7.quest_desc: [
		"Solid fuels can be potent, but they lack finesse as they’ll continue to generate pressure until the entire piece of fuel has burned, even if the compressor is disabled by redstone."
		""
		"Consider upgrading to a safer fuel source."
	]
	quest.00000000000000CC.quest_desc: ["Where pressurized air is your primary power supply, heat is a secondary but just as vital mechanic. Advanced Compressors and other machines rely on either heating them up or cooling them down to run properly."]
	quest.00000000000000CC.title: "Subzero"
	quest.00000000000000CF.quest_desc: [
		"Built on the principle of swirling high pressure air in a special chamber to create a temperature differential, the Vortex Tube allows you to finely control the amount of heating or cooling it does by controlling the pressure."
		""
		"The Vortex Tube isn’t the only way to generate Heat, however. Looking up uses on Heat Pipes in JEI will bring up a variety of blocks and liquids that may be used for heating and cooling as well. "
		""
		"Lastly, PneumaticCraft has built in support for Mekanism’s Heat system and compatibility with Integrated Dynamics. Some notable heat sources include:"
		""
		"● External Heater"
		"● Resistive Heater"
		"● Fuelwood Heater"
	]
	quest.00000000000000D2.quest_desc: ["&6Heat Pipe&r is useful for transmitting heat between blocks quickly and without loss to the environment. Use it to move heat from a Vortex Tube to one or more machines. Heat can also be used to directly power a Furnace."]
	quest.00000000000000D2.title: "Heat Pipe"
	quest.00000000000000D5.quest_desc: [
		"You may have noted by now that the Vortex Tube uses a lot of air and does not respond to redstone. In order to turn it off, the air supply must be cut. A Regulator Tube Module allows you to do just that."
		""
		"Place it in line in your Pressure Tube and apply a redstone signal to it. A signal of 15 will fully disable the flow of air, turning off any machines down the line."
	]
	quest.00000000000000D9.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Heat Frame&r is placed on any inventory and allows the inventory to make use of heat or cold to perform crafting operations. When heated, it smelts items as a furnace would. When cooled, it can make a variety of useful items."
		""
		"In order to cool liquids, fill a PneumaticCraft tank or a bucket and place it inside the inventory. The cooled items will appear in the chest as long as there's room."
	]
	quest.00000000000000DC.quest_desc: [
		"The &eUniversal Sensor&r is a powerful block that will output a redstone signal based on various conditions, such as detecting a nearby player, when a player right clicks a block, the presence of blocks, light level, or even the current heat of a block."
		""
		"When reading heat, try aiming it at a heat pipe or a PNC:R machine, rather than at an inventory with a heat frame."
	]
	quest.00000000000000E0.quest_desc: ["Go scoop up a bucket of oil like some filthy mongrel. You’ll find it commonly above ground and it’s easily spotted by watching your minimap."]
	quest.00000000000000E0.title: "Crude and Un-Cultured"
	quest.00000000000000E2.quest_desc: [
		"The Gas Lift can be used to pump up fluids from the world. Place it above a source block of any fluid, insert drill pipes, and provide air. The pipes will extend down to a source and the lift will attempt to pull all nearby connected source blocks."
		""
		"Sneak + Right click any PNC:R block with a Pneumatic Wrench to instantly pick it up while retaining the stored air and upgrades. This also works on Pressure Chamber Valves."
	]
	quest.00000000000000E7.quest_desc: [
		"The &eRefinery&r is built by placing the &eController&r and stacking 2-4 outputs on top of it. Be sure to insulate all of the sides! Consider using a logistics network to extract the outputs for further processing. Supply heat and oil to begin the process. "
		""
		"A Comparator reading from the Controller is an excellent way of controlling your Vortex Tube to prevent wasting fuel."
	]
	quest.00000000000000E7.title: "Oil Refinery"
	quest.00000000000000EA.quest_desc: [
		"TPP for short, this machine uses a combination of heat and pressure to transform solids and liquids. It has even found use in the kitchen in recent years. "
		""
		"Placing the machines in a row allows them to share both heat and pressure through their sides. "
	]
	quest.00000000000000EA.title: "Thermopneumatic Processing"
	quest.00000000000000EE.quest_desc: ["Extremely valuable for creating Speed Upgrades."]
	quest.00000000000000EE.title: "Lubricant"
	quest.00000000000000F1.quest_desc: ["Need more? Consider converting some of your other fuels."]
	quest.00000000000000F1.title: "LPG"
	quest.00000000000000F4.quest_desc: ["A drop in the sea to come."]
	quest.00000000000000F4.title: "Molten Plastic"
	quest.00000000000000F8.quest_desc: ["It's a decent fuel... but perhaps a little transformation is in order."]
	quest.00000000000000F8.title: "Diesel"
	quest.00000000000000FB.quest_desc: ["The Fluid Mixer is primarily used as the final step in the Biodiesel processing chain. It also creates a very useful byproduct, Glycerol."]
	quest.00000000000000FB.quest_subtitle: "Mixin’ It Up"
	quest.00000000000000FD.quest_desc: [
		"The first step to producing renewable plastic and lubricant, creating Yeast Culture with a TPP will require precise heat control."
		""
		"Experiment with low power heat sources such as torches, varying levels of insulation, or even different biomes or dimensions to find a way to produce the culture reliably."
	]
	quest.00000000000000FD.title: "Yeast Culture"
	quest.0000000000000100.quest_desc: ["Ethanol could be burned on its own, but it could be refined, which is definitely worth doing!"]
	quest.0000000000000100.title: "Ethanol"
	quest.0000000000000103.quest_desc: ["Or any seed, for that matter."]
	quest.0000000000000103.quest_subtitle: "Give Peas a Chance"
	quest.0000000000000103.title: "Vegetable Oil"
	quest.0000000000000107.quest_desc: ["A sustainable way forward."]
	quest.0000000000000107.title: "Biodiesel"
	quest.000000000000010B.quest_desc: [
		"&2Logistics Frames&r and Modules are the heart and soul of the logistics network. Frames can be installed on any inventory and configured with a Logistical Configurator."
		""
		"For more complex setups, it may be necessary to ‘extend’ the machine by using other inventories. "
		""
		"For example, you may use a requester frame on a furnace to pull items into it, then pull the result out with a hopper. A provider frame on the hopper can then send back into the network."
	]
	quest.000000000000010B.title: "Logistics"
	quest.0000000000000110.quest_desc: ["A blast resistant chest that retains its contents when broken."]
	quest.0000000000000114.quest_desc: ["An advanced version of the Reinforced Chest featuring a larger inventory, per slot item type and quantity filtering, ranged item collection, and the ability to push and pull items to and from nearby inventories."]
	quest.0000000000000119.quest_desc: ["Filterable and fast, PNC Hoppers can be oriented however you like and accept multiple useful upgrades. Check their GUI for more info."]
	quest.0000000000000119.title: "Hoppers"
	quest.000000000000011D.quest_desc: [
		"The Logistics system for PNC:R is quite powerful, though it requires some fore-thought in implementation and has an upkeep cost in air for moving items and fluid around. "
		""
		"When used over a pressure tube network, it allows for instantaneous movement of large amounts of items and fluids through the same line simultaneously."
	]
	quest.000000000000011D.title: "The Logical Path Forward"
	quest.0000000000000120.quest_desc: [
		"&eRedstone Modules&r are used to read and output redstone signals by transmitting them over a pipe network.This does not require air to use."
		""
		"Install a Module Expansion Card into one to allow it to perform much more complicated operations, such as acting as a clock, a signal counter, or a toggle. "
	]
	quest.0000000000000120.title: "Redstone Modules"
	quest.0000000000000123.quest_desc: [
		"&aModule Expansion Cards&r are inserted into various tube modules to enhance their capabilities. Regulator Tube Modules, Pressure Gauge Tube Modules, Redstone Modules,and Air Grate Modules all benefit greatly from it."
		""
		"Consider upgrading the redstone control on your compressor using a combination of an advanced Pressure Gauge Module and some redstone modules."
	]
	quest.0000000000000123.quest_subtitle: "Raspberry Pi"
	quest.0000000000000126.quest_desc: ["&eLogistics Drones&r are handy little helpers in places where you don’t want to run a full air infrastructure. Experiment with some logistics frames and deploy a logistics drone to move the items for you."]
	quest.0000000000000126.quest_subtitle: "Flying Circus"
	quest.0000000000000129.quest_desc: [
		"Craft and deploy a &9Harvest Drone&r to automate a crop farm or a tree farm. Use a Collector Drone to keep things tidy."
		""
		"Refer to the PNC Manual or the item tooltips for instructions on how they work."
	]
	quest.000000000000012C.quest_desc: [
		"The &2Charging Station&r is vital for keeping drones charged automatically. Place one down and insert a &dDispenser Upgrade&r into it to allow it to charge entities above it. Nearby drones will automatically seek out available charging stations when needed."
		""
		"Standing on such a &2Charging Station&r will also charge items in your inventory."
	]
	quest.000000000000012F.quest_desc: ["Install one or more Item Life Upgrades in your drones to help them stay in working order. They can occasionally take damage from environmental hazards and these upgrades will cause them to self repair."]
	quest.000000000000012F.quest_subtitle: "In Her Time of Need"
	quest.0000000000000132.quest_desc: ["Install a Standby Upgrade in a drone to conserve a little air."]
	quest.0000000000000135.quest_desc: ["Install some Inventory Upgrades in your Collector Drone."]
	quest.0000000000000135.title: "Inventory Upgrade"
	quest.0000000000000138.quest_desc: ["Install a few Range Upgrades in your Collector Drone."]
	quest.0000000000000138.quest_subtitle: "He's Going the Distance"
	quest.000000000000013B.quest_desc: ["Speed things up with a few of these in your Drones, or many other blocks."]
	quest.000000000000013E.quest_desc: [
		"&dProgrammable Drones&r are the pinnacle of PNC:R’s automation capabilities and the options are near limitless as they can interact with blocks and entities, wield weapons and tools, and perform their actions based on complex conditions."
		""
		"Take a dive into this visual programming language and see what you can come up with! If you’re short of ideas, try some of these:"
		""
		""
		"● Automate &o&3Botania’s Runic Altar&r"
		"● Automate &o&dPNC:R’s Biodiesel&r"
	]
	quest.000000000000013E.title: "Programmable Drones"
	quest.0000000000000142.quest_desc: ["&cRemotes&r are programmable interface devices that work by manipulating global variables. You can use these for remote redstone when combined with a Universal Sensor, or they can be used to control programmable drones."]
	quest.0000000000000145.quest_desc: ["Cooling &ePlastic&r by &o&bdumping&r a bucket in the world will get you started, but surely there’s a better way?"]
	quest.0000000000000145.title: "Plastic"
	quest.0000000000000148.quest_desc: ["The pinnacle of stay-at-home shopping. Click a button and your order is there before you know it. "]
	quest.0000000000000148.title: "Prime Delivery"
	quest.000000000000014B.quest_desc: ["Always available from Amadron, any time, any day. But your local Pressure Mechanic commonly carries them as an initial trade as well…"]
	quest.000000000000014E.quest_desc: [
		"Used to prepare Empty PCBs for etching. This can be a slow process without speed upgrades… Consider setting a threshold around 60-70% to have a decent chance of etching while waiting less. Automating this process is highly recommended."
		""
		"Failed PCBs can be recycled."
	]
	quest.0000000000000151.quest_desc: [
		"The next step of creating Circuit Boards is to etch them in this tank, which can hold and simultaneously process as many as 25 Empty PCBs."
		""
		"The acid is only consumed if heat is applied while etching a board."
		""
		"Doing so significantly speeds up the etching process and a single bucket will last for many PCBs."
	]
	quest.0000000000000151.title: "Etching Tank"
	quest.0000000000000155.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Assembly Table&r provides a simpler way of making circuit boards and provides access to other advanced recipes."
		""
		"Each piece has limitations on where it can be placed. Refer to the PNC:R manual for the exact placement rules."
		""
		"A simple layout can be done in a 2x3 space, however:"
		""
		"&eIO&r (&bimport&r), &2Controller&r, &eIO&r (&bexport&r), &dDrill&r, &9Table&r, &6Laser&r"
	]
	quest.0000000000000155.title: "Assembly Table"
	quest.0000000000000168.quest_desc: [
		"Insert it into the Assembly Controller and provide air to get it started. Speed upgrades are highly recommended."
		""
		"The Drill \\& Laser program allows the Assembly Table to craft recipes that require only a drill or laser. In most cases there’s no reason to use the individual programs."
	]
	quest.0000000000000168.title: "Assembly Program"
	quest.000000000000016B.quest_desc: [
		"Portable Fluid Storage. Also capable of filling buckets and other tanks for automation purposes."
		""
		"Stack them vertically and right click with a Pneumatic Wrench to form a multiblock tank."
	]
	quest.000000000000016B.title: "Fluid Tanks"
	quest.0000000000000171.quest_subtitle: "*Unlocked by completing the &b&n&oSign the contract&r quest*"
	quest.0000000000000179.title: "Drawer Key's"
	quest.0000000000000415.quest_desc: [
		"With advanced machining methods, stronger pressure tubes may be made and higher pressure attained."
		""
		"&5Advanced Compressors&r must be kept cool, and therefore are not always the best option for a given task."
		""
		"Some machines will only begin to work, however, at the pressures made by an advanced compressor."
	]
	quest.0000000000000417.quest_desc: [
		"Keeping things under pressure is only one side of the coin. Creating a vacuum can be very beneficial as well."
		""
		"A &ePressure Chamber&r in Vacuum can be used to extract enchants from items."
	]
	quest.0000000000000554.quest_subtitle: "*Unlocked by completing the &b&n&oThe Iron Tools&r quest*"
